## Layout

```
apps/           input programs (apps.json lists active ones)
asm/            decoder, phases, emitter, verifier, disassembler 
asm_DSAVANT/    generated NASM (+ C) for Wizardry 7 
debugger/       16 bit TSR dbg proxy for inside dosbox
```
 